WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Invites. Invite people with a one-time link or by email, and revoke invites that haven't been used.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: onboarding a new hire; sharing in a chat.

3
00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:11.930
Invite by email: type their address…

4
00:00:11.930 --> 00:00:13.430
…pick the role they'll join with…

5
00:00:13.430 --> 00:00:15.210
…and send it. Only that address can accept it.

6
00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:18.610
Or make a one-time link to share yourself.

7
00:00:18.610 --> 00:00:20.530
Unused invites are listed under Pending invites.

8
00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:24.170
Revoke kills a link immediately.

9
00:00:24.170 --> 00:00:30.170
“Invite failed” when opening a link: The link was already used, revoked, expired, or was emailed to a different address. Ask for a new one. “… is already a member”: That person is in the workspace already; change their role instead.

10
00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:34.670
One-time links that expire in 7 days
